From: AVCRT Development <avcrt@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] audio: spf: track cellular TX and lease USB uplink cutoff

Track the acknowledged voice graph and current codec or USB TX leg,
including a bounded retry after a rejected reroute START. Bind USB stock
TX cutoff to a single live route and owner, verify the DSP mute state,
and restore it on expiry or route loss. Observe private capture STOP/CLOSE
ACKs so userspace can decide whether it is safe to restart.

